D3_CH_ACTIVE_OCCUPANCY;

D3_CH_PUSH_PULL.

No margin-vs-occupancy sweep.

A41/A42 already established
that occupancy is
the stronger local-amplitude field
under the frozen no-gain normalization.

A49 asks
whether that strongest safe field
becomes macro-useful
once the core itself survives.

